1
00:00:00,048 --> 00:00:04,040
Rwanda nziza Gihugu cyacu

2
00:00:04,058 --> 00:00:09,044
Wuje imisozi, ibiyaga n'ibirunga

3
00:00:09,068 --> 00:00:14,038
Ngobyi iduhetse gahorane ishya.

4
00:00:15,028 --> 00:00:19,047
Reka tukurate tukuvuge ibigwi

5
00:00:19,097 --> 00:00:23,051
Wowe utubumbiye hamwe twese

6
00:00:23,064 --> 00:00:27,091
Abanyarwanda uko watubyaye

7
00:00:28,061 --> 00:00:34,088
Berwa, sugira, singizwa iteka.

8
00:00:36,057 --> 00:00:40,045
Horana Imana, murage mwiza

9
00:00:40,099 --> 00:00:45,079
Ibyo tugukesha ntibishyikirwa;

10
00:00:46,047 --> 00:00:50,007
Umuco dusangiye uraturanga

11
00:00:50,064 --> 00:00:55,015
Ururimi rwacu rukaduhuza

12
00:00:55,070 --> 00:00:59,048
Ubwenge, umutima,amaboko yacu

13
00:00:59,049 --> 00:01:03,073
Nibigukungahaze bikwiye

14
00:01:03,097 --> 00:01:08,043
Nuko utere imbere ubutitsa.

15
00:01:09,027 --> 00:01:13,019
Abakurambere b'intwari

16
00:01:13,074 --> 00:01:17,097
Bitanze batizigama

17
00:01:18,017 --> 00:01:22,041
Baraguhanga uvamo ubukombe

18
00:01:22,092 --> 00:01:27,063
Utsinda ubukoroni na mpatsibihugu

19
00:01:27,088 --> 00:01:31,006
Byayogoje Afurika yose

20
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:35,015
None uraganje mu bwigenge

21
00:01:35,041 --> 00:01:40,087
Tubukomeyeho uko turi twese.

22
00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:46,022
Komeza imihigo Rwanda dukunda

23
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:50,030
Duhagurukiye kukwitangira

24
00:01:50,077 --> 00:01:55,047
Ngo amahoro asabe mu bagutuye

25
00:01:56,006 --> 00:02:00,008
Wishyire wizane muri byose

26
00:02:00,054 --> 00:02:03,081
Urangwe n'ishyaka, utere imbere

27
00:02:03,097 --> 00:02:07,070
Uhamye umubano n'amahanga yose

28
00:02:08,034 --> 00:02:15,099
Maze ijabo ryawe riguhe ijambo.